set_option linter.unusedVariables false

/-!
# A347148

Square array read by antidiagonals: T(n,0) = T(0,k) = 1 and for n > 0, k > 0, T(n,k) = Sum_{i=1..min(n,k)} (T(n-i,k) + T(n,k-i)).

The 66 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A347148

